00:02:39.628 --> 00:02:42.128
that's when your life changes.

00:02:42.985 --> 00:02:46.896
The difference in people
is their standards, period.

00:02:46.896 --> 00:02:50.670
The difference in people
is their standards, period.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.262
And what do I mean by standards?

00:02:53.262 --> 00:02:55.785
Everyone in the world

00:02:55.785 --> 00:02:59.903
has a list of things they
think they should do.

00:02:59.903 --> 00:03:02.708
I should lose weight, I should work out,

00:03:02.708 --> 00:03:05.628
I should spend more time with my kids,

00:03:05.628 --> 00:03:09.096
I should work harder, I
should make more calls,

00:03:09.096 --> 00:03:12.304
I should, I should, I should, I should

00:03:12.304 --> 00:03:13.662
