shit all over themselves.

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:20.507
They beat themself up about it.

00:03:20.507 --> 00:03:24.674
What changes people is when
your should becomes a must,

00:03:25.552 --> 00:03:27.519
when suddenly the thing you said

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:30.022
