00:03:48.078 --> 00:03:50.310
That's what makes human beings succeed.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.903
So you really have to decide.

00:03:51.903 --> 00:03:54.737
The most important decision
is do I want to be happy?

00:03:54.737 --> 00:03:56.222
Will I commit to being happy?

00:03:56.222 --> 00:03:57.729
More important than happy.

00:03:57.729 --> 00:03:59.079
Sometimes you'd be so happy,

00:03:59.079 --> 00:04:00.684
