00:04:01.517 --> 00:04:04.396
Am I committed to living
in a beautiful state

00:04:04.396 --> 00:04:06.511
even when it doesn't go my way?

00:04:06.511 --> 00:04:08.353
Even when it rains on my parade?

00:04:08.353 --> 00:04:10.782
Even when my biggest fear shows up?

00:04:10.782 --> 00:04:12.307
Because I can't control

00:04:12.307 --> 00:04:14.557
whether your husband or
wife will live or die

00:04:14.557 --> 00:04:16.635
or get sick or leave you or get a divorce.

00:04:16.635 --> 00:04:18.474
I don't want any of that to
happen to any human being.

00:04:18.474 --> 00:04:19.307
I hate suffering.

00:04:19.307 --> 00:04:22.176
I'd do anything I can to
help people not suffer

00:04:22.176 --> 00:04:24.338
but I can't control that, you can.

00:04:24.338 --> 00:04:26.564
You can, there are people
who have lost their arms,

00:04:26.564 --> 00:04:27.410
