00:04:58.162 --> 00:04:59.950
What I'm going to do
is something different.

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:02.277
And the way I get out of suffering,

00:05:02.277 --> 00:05:04.104
I give myself a 90-second rule.

00:05:04.104 --> 00:05:05.026
It's really simple.

00:05:05.026 --> 00:05:07.664
I say look, if I feel myself
starting to feel that stress

00:05:07.664 --> 00:05:10.074
