00:05:20.634 --> 00:05:21.530
Look at that crazy thought.

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:22.488
'Cause everybody's had crazy thoughts.

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:23.321
Everybody's had a thought,

00:05:23.321 --> 00:05:24.479
