00:09:44.952 --> 00:09:46.330
It's almost like God is saying

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.612
if you keep hitting this wall enough times

00:09:48.612 --> 00:09:50.516
I will see that you will not stop,

00:09:50.516 --> 00:09:51.349
that you are filled

00:09:51.349 --> 00:09:53.825
with that level of
determination, faith, and courage

00:09:53.825 --> 00:09:56.902
and then the door opens and
you get to that next level

00:09:56.902 --> 00:09:58.703
but what most people don't know is

00:09:58.703 --> 00:10:03.188
the next level is just
two millimeters above

00:10:03.188 --> 00:10:05.337
and it's called outstanding,

00:10:05.337 --> 00:10:07.868
ladies and gentlemen, outstanding.

00:10:07.868 --> 00:10:09.188
What's it called?

00:10:09.188 --> 00:10:10.510
- [Audience] Outstanding!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.359
- What's it called?

00:10:11.359 --> 00:10:12.344
- [Audience] Outstanding!

00:10:12.344 --> 00:10:13.273
- What's it called?

00:10:13.273 --> 00:10:14.262
- [Audience] Outstanding!

00:10:14.262 --> 00:10:18.130
- Outstanding, magnificent,
unstoppable, extraordinary!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.716
Not excellent, it's a different level.

00:10:21.716 --> 00:10:25.458
It's a level where you
are not one of the best

00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:26.816
you are the best.

00:10:26.816 --> 00:10:28.035
And you know what's amazing,

00:10:28.035 --> 00:10:30.984
you only have to be two millimeters
more than everybody else

00:10:30.984 --> 00:10:31.983
and you get everything.

00:10:31.983 --> 00:10:33.563
You get the joy, the laughter, the fun,

00:10:33.563 --> 00:10:35.563
the family, the passion, the economics,

00:10:35.563 --> 00:10:37.889
the freedom, the spirit, it's all there.

00:10:37.889 --> 00:10:41.289
What Jerry Maguire called the quad, baby.

00:10:41.289 --> 00:10:44.784
All of it and it's just
two millimeters above

00:10:44.784 --> 00:10:47.162
and most excellent people give up

00:10:47.162 --> 00:10:48.508
because they're exhausted

00:10:48.508 --> 00:10:49.744
and there's some people that go

00:10:49.744 --> 00:10:52.165
the harder I hit it, the more I hit it,

00:10:52.165 --> 00:10:54.834
sooner or later it's going
down, I'm not stopping.

00:10:54.834 --> 00:10:56.852
And when you do that enough, it pops open.

00:10:56.852 --> 00:10:58.680
If you're obsessed,
you know what you want,

00:10:58.680 --> 00:10:59.732
you take a massive action,

00:10:59.732 --> 00:11:00.565
maybe you modeled,

00:11:00.565 --> 00:11:01.848
somebody figured out the right action.

00:11:01.848 --> 00:11:04.534
So you get there quicker
and you're executing.

00:11:04.534 --> 00:11:06.447
You still need a little grace.

00:11:06.447 --> 00:11:08.008
Some people call it luck.

00:11:08.008 --> 00:11:09.547
You could call it God

00:11:09.547 --> 00:11:12.256
but I really believe that
there's the part we do

00:11:12.256 --> 00:11:13.980
and then there's the
part that comes to us.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.603
But I do know, grace shows up a lot more

00:11:16.603 --> 00:11:18.649
when you do the first
two steps on your own

00:11:18.649 --> 00:11:20.149
and grace shows up a lot more

00:11:20.149 --> 00:11:21.836
when you acknowledge grace in your life,

00:11:21.836 --> 00:11:23.965
when you acknowledge that
I was born in a world

00:11:23.965 --> 00:11:25.662
where I didn't have to
build this internet,

00:11:25.662 --> 00:11:27.079
that I can pull out of my pocket

00:11:27.079 --> 00:11:28.401
the answer to anything on earth,

00:11:28.401 --> 00:11:30.395
I'm driving on streets that I didn't pave,

00:11:30.395 --> 00:11:32.405
I'm reading books I didn't have to write.

00:11:32.405 --> 00:11:33.926
That's the gift of our lives

00:11:33.926 --> 00:11:35.368
and I think when we experience that grace

00:11:35.368 --> 00:11:37.585
we don't just experience more achievement

00:11:37.585 --> 00:11:39.157
but we start to experience
more fulfillment.

00:11:39.157 --> 00:11:41.226
- And grace not only affects
your ability to get there

00:11:41.226 --> 00:11:43.933
but it affects what
you do and how you live

00:11:43.933 --> 00:11:44.916
once you are there.

00:11:44.916 --> 00:11:46.684
- It really determines
the quality of your life

00:11:46.684 --> 00:11:50.027
because unless you live
in a state of gratitude,

00:11:50.027 --> 00:11:53.565
I did an interview with Sir John Templeton

00:11:53.565 --> 00:11:56.235
who as you know is one of the
first billionaire investors

00:11:56.235 --> 00:11:57.134
and just a brilliant man.

00:11:57.134 --> 00:12:00.164
He came from nothing and he donated,

00:12:00.164 --> 00:12:00.997
I think it was 750,

00:12:00.997 --> 00:12:02.337
they still do it, the Templeton Fund,

00:12:02.337 --> 00:12:04.004
I think it's 750 million dollars a year.

00:12:04.004 --> 00:12:06.868
It's bigger than the Nobel
Fund that he donates.

00:12:06.868 --> 00:12:08.534
And one day I asked him I said,

00:12:08.534 --> 00:12:10.563
"What is the secret to wealth?"

00:12:10.563 --> 00:12:12.499
And he looked at me, paused,

00:12:12.499 --> 00:12:14.201
this big smile and his
eyes got really bright,

00:12:14.201 --> 00:12:16.618
like they always did and he said,

00:12:16.618 --> 00:12:17.932
"Tony, it's what you teach."

00:12:17.932 --> 00:12:20.061
I said, "Well I teach a lot
of things, which thing?"

00:12:20.061 --> 00:12:21.988
And he said, "Gratitude."

00:12:21.988 --> 00:12:23.599
He said, "Because you and I, Tony,

00:12:23.599 --> 00:12:25.605
"know billionaires that are miserable

00:12:25.605 --> 00:12:27.847
"and it's because they're not
grateful for what they have

00:12:27.847 --> 00:12:30.330
"and we both know people
who have no money seemingly

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.334
"but they're so grateful for their health,

00:12:32.334 --> 00:12:33.887
"for their husbands, for their
wife, for their children,

00:12:33.887 --> 00:12:34.993
"they're so grateful to God,

00:12:34.993 --> 00:12:38.010
"they're so grateful for
their life that they're rich."

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:40.642
So I think it starts with that gratitude,

00:12:40.642 --> 00:12:42.306
it starts with that connection to grace

00:12:42.306 --> 00:12:43.397
as simplistic as that sounds

00:12:43.397 --> 00:12:45.399
and so it's not enough just
to have your financial plan.

00:12:45.399 --> 00:12:46.844
You can have all the
money and be miserable.

00:12:46.844 --> 00:12:48.697
Let's have the money and be really rich

00:12:48.697 --> 00:12:50.769
emotionally, psychologically,
and spiritually.

00:12:50.769 --> 00:12:53.203
Failure is part of life, I mean,

00:12:53.203 --> 00:12:54.711
the difference for me though

00:12:54.711 --> 00:12:56.880
is I look at failure as a
stepping stone to success.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.488
It's a speed bump.

00:12:58.488 --> 00:13:00.099
I know I'm going to fail

00:13:00.099 --> 00:13:02.013
but it's not failure
if you learn something

00:13:02.013 --> 00:13:04.756
and so, gosh, I've made so many mistakes.

00:13:04.756 --> 00:13:06.028
I've screwed so many things up

00:13:06.028 --> 00:13:09.137
but every time I do it just becomes,

00:13:09.137 --> 00:13:10.528
it becomes a way for me

00:13:10.528 --> 00:13:12.540
to explain to someone else what it takes.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.122
It's like here's what I've done.

00:13:14.122 --> 00:13:16.352
I think I have the ability
to influence people

00:13:16.352 --> 00:13:18.006
'cause I talk about my failures,

00:13:18.006 --> 00:13:20.223
I talk about all the
things that mess me up

00:13:20.223 --> 00:13:21.970
but I show people that
I didn't let it stop me

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:22.948
and you don't need to let it stop you.

00:13:22.948 --> 00:13:25.381
And I think that's really
the secret in that area.

00:13:25.381 --> 00:13:27.098
- And if everything you
touched was successful

00:13:27.098 --> 00:13:29.039
you probably wouldn't be able
to relate to people as much.

00:13:29.039 --> 00:13:29.872
- No, you wouldn't be able to relate

00:13:29.872 --> 00:13:30.805
and also it'd be total bull

00:13:30.805 --> 00:13:32.484
and everyone'd know it's bull.

00:13:32.484 --> 00:13:34.236
And also you'd be bored silly.

00:13:34.236 --> 00:13:35.737
I mean think about it, if you just said

00:13:35.737 --> 00:13:36.728
I want this and it happened,

00:13:36.728 --> 00:13:38.895
I want this and it happened,

00:13:38.895 --> 00:13:41.575
people don't value what
they don't fight for.

00:13:41.575 --> 00:13:43.997
It's like you see kids sometimes,

00:13:43.997 --> 00:13:45.328
your parents will say you're
not going to value this

00:13:45.328 --> 00:13:46.436
if you don't work for it.

00:13:46.436 --> 00:13:47.655
And you're a kid you're going,

00:13:47.655 --> 00:13:48.965
"I'll value it, just give it to me."

00:13:48.965 --> 00:13:50.175
But it's true.

00:13:50.175 --> 00:13:52.704
The things we've worked the hardest for,

00:13:52.704 --> 00:13:53.770
we value the most.

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:57.656
So I think the purpose of the
goal is not getting it anyway.

00:13:57.656 --> 00:14:00.015
The purpose of the goal
is what, who you become.

00:14:00.015 --> 00:14:02.056
Who you become is going
to make you happier

00:14:02.056 --> 00:14:03.407
or it's going to make you sad.

00:14:03.407 --> 00:14:05.424
So I'm not looking for
an effortless approaches.

00:14:05.424 --> 00:14:06.367
- Sure, sure, sure.

00:14:06.367 --> 00:14:07.200
- There's no such thing.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:11.005
- So Tony, one of the critics
actually that I once met said,

00:14:11.005 --> 00:14:11.838
"Yeah Tony's techniques,

00:14:11.838 --> 00:14:13.271
"they were great for
about a year and a half

00:14:13.271 --> 00:14:14.456
"and then they wore off."

00:14:14.456 --> 00:14:15.405
(Tony laughing)

00:14:15.405 --> 00:14:17.670
What do you say to those folks who say--

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:18.665
- Real simple, if you don't work out

00:14:18.665 --> 00:14:20.134
you don't get a muscle, right?

00:14:20.134 --> 00:14:20.967
So I always tell people,

00:14:20.967 --> 00:14:22.987
this is, there's a daily
practice like priming,

00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:24.159
if you don't do that,

00:14:24.159 --> 00:14:26.843
if you get up and you have
no discipline whatsoever

00:14:26.843 --> 00:14:27.676
you get no value of anything.

00:14:27.676 --> 00:14:29.355
Diets don't work when you don't do them,

00:14:29.355 --> 00:14:30.866
exercise doesn't work
when you don't do them

00:14:30.866 --> 00:14:33.170
but most of the people
that have some experiences

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:34.443
that they want to shift

00:14:34.443 --> 00:14:35.858
and once you shift those things,

00:14:35.858 --> 00:14:36.844
your whole life changes.

00:14:36.844 --> 00:14:38.334
But life is constant growth.

00:14:38.334 --> 00:14:40.649
My life isn't here 'cause I
went to one seminar one time

00:14:40.649 --> 00:14:42.532
and now my life is fit for life.

00:14:42.532 --> 00:14:45.412
I work out, I train my
mind, I train my body.

00:14:45.412 --> 00:14:46.626
It becomes a lifestyle.

00:14:46.626 --> 00:14:48.802
It's not just like you're
depending upon somebody else.

00:14:48.802 --> 00:14:50.346
I'm not here to become somebody's guru.

00:14:50.346 --> 00:14:51.504
I'm not here to give them a gift.

00:14:51.504 --> 00:14:53.417
I'm here for them to
open up their own gifts

00:14:53.417 --> 00:14:55.133
and that's really what my work has been.

00:14:55.133 --> 00:14:56.263
The only way to deal with fear

00:14:56.263 --> 00:14:57.550
that I found in my life

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:58.769
there's a couple ways.

00:14:58.769 --> 00:15:01.828
One of those ways is to turn it on itself

00:15:01.828 --> 00:15:04.257
and ask yourself what am I afraid of?

00:15:04.257 --> 00:15:05.169
I'm afraid of that?

00:15:05.169 --> 00:15:07.796
I got to be more afraid of
what I'm going to miss out on,

00:15:07.796 --> 00:15:08.629
missing out on my mission,

00:15:08.629 --> 00:15:10.199
missing out on who I'm supposed to be,

00:15:10.199 --> 00:15:12.636
missing, in other words if
you're not getting rid of fear

00:15:12.636 --> 00:15:15.447
than use fear, use fear or it uses you.

00:15:15.447 --> 00:15:16.422
It's that simple.

00:15:16.422 --> 00:15:18.488
So you got to say, okay what's the price

00:15:18.488 --> 00:15:20.039
if I just stay doing this?

00:15:20.039 --> 00:15:20.872
What's the price?

00:15:20.872 --> 00:15:22.435
I need to really get scared

00:15:22.435 --> 00:15:24.833
if I learn all this and
I don't follow through.

00:15:24.833 --> 00:15:26.784
That's something to be scared about

00:15:26.784 --> 00:15:29.372
and then that fear will
get you over your fear.

00:15:29.372 --> 00:15:30.255
It'll push you through,

00:15:30.255 --> 00:15:31.697
turn fear in itself.

00:15:31.697 --> 00:15:33.100
Second way you can do it

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:34.967
is use what you've probably heard me say

00:15:34.967 --> 00:15:36.666
'cause I've used it since I was 17,

00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:38.628
is my little rocking chair test, right?

00:15:38.628 --> 00:15:40.998
I'm going to sit myself
in my rocking chair.

00:15:40.998 --> 00:15:43.367
I'm 85 years old and
looking back on my life

00:15:43.367 --> 00:15:46.450
and I say, I didn't do this or I did.

00:15:47.291 --> 00:15:49.245
If you find your passion,

00:15:49.245 --> 00:15:51.652
you're going to have
this tremendous energy

00:15:51.652 --> 00:15:53.823
of sustainable energy

00:15:53.823 --> 00:15:57.552
but momentum requires you
always do the next thing

00:15:57.552 --> 00:15:59.207
that keeps the momentum going

00:15:59.207 --> 00:16:03.796
and the reason you get
yourself in a passionate place

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:05.692
is so that you change your life

00:16:05.692 --> 00:16:07.209
and the only thing that changes your life

00:16:07.209 --> 00:16:08.792
is making a decision.

00:16:08.792 --> 00:16:11.969
So while you're in this passionate state

00:16:11.969 --> 00:16:14.297
that's where you make decisions.

00:16:14.297 --> 00:16:17.643
You don't make decisions when you're like,

00:16:17.643 --> 00:16:18.974
oh I don't know, what do you think?

00:16:18.974 --> 00:16:20.548
All right let's decide.

00:16:20.548 --> 00:16:24.095
If you make a decision in
a state without momentum,

00:16:24.095 --> 00:16:25.303
if you make a decision

00:16:25.303 --> 00:16:27.139
from a place where there's no passion,

00:16:27.139 --> 00:16:28.833
you are not going to get momentum.

00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:30.603
It will kill momentum.

00:16:30.603 --> 00:16:33.270
It's decide, commit and resolve.

00:16:36.036 --> 00:16:38.591
Some of you in the past,

00:16:38.591 --> 00:16:41.799
you've gotten momentum,
you've gotten passionate,

00:16:41.799 --> 00:16:44.049
you've even made a decision

00:16:44.989 --> 00:16:48.301
but a decision is the first step,

00:16:48.301 --> 00:16:50.140
decision is like a war,

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.461
I got to do this or that.

00:16:51.461 --> 00:16:54.044
Alright, I'm going to make myself do this

00:16:54.044 --> 00:16:56.877
but commitment is when you nail

00:16:56.877 --> 00:17:00.668
after you've decided you commit
to do this for the long term

00:17:00.668 --> 00:17:02.967
whether it's hard or easy doesn't matter,

00:17:02.967 --> 00:17:04.913
you're doing this.

00:17:04.913 --> 00:17:07.076
It takes it from this moment

00:17:07.076 --> 00:17:08.829
and it carries it into the future

00:17:08.829 --> 00:17:10.528
even when things are difficult.

00:17:10.528 --> 00:17:13.111
And the third state is resolve.

00:17:14.466 --> 00:17:16.549
Resolved means it's done.

00:17:18.482 --> 00:17:20.687
It's like, it doesn't
even if you took action,

00:17:20.687 --> 00:17:22.182
it's done inside you

00:17:22.182 --> 00:17:23.476
so it's done out there.

00:17:23.476 --> 00:17:25.350
There's no question whatsoever.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:27.100
Then once you decide,

00:17:28.011 --> 00:17:29.710
the only way the commitment

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.749
and the energy and the momentum continues

00:17:31.749 --> 00:17:35.336
is if you take immediate
massive, what my friends?

00:17:35.336 --> 00:17:37.158
Massive what?

00:17:37.158 --> 00:17:38.697
Write down in your notes.

00:17:38.697 --> 00:17:41.280
Massive action is the cure-all.

00:17:42.877 --> 00:17:46.196
Massive action is the cure-all.

00:17:46.196 --> 00:17:48.774
If you're having a difficult
time with something,

00:17:48.774 --> 00:17:51.275
your relationship isn't
where you want it to be,

00:17:51.275 --> 00:17:53.387
your finances are not
where you want to be,

00:17:53.387 --> 00:17:54.849
your body is not where you want to be,

00:17:54.849 --> 00:17:56.515
your business is not where you want to be.

00:17:56.515 --> 00:17:58.451
you need to take massive action!

00:17:58.451 --> 00:18:00.195
And if that doesn't
work, try something else.

00:18:00.195 --> 00:18:01.929
If that doesn't work try something else.

00:18:01.929 --> 00:18:04.354
Keep going with massive action

00:18:04.354 --> 00:18:06.063
and you will find the way

00:18:06.063 --> 00:18:08.896
because it will give you momentum.

00:18:10.765 --> 00:18:12.192
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:18:12.192 --> 00:18:15.104
We're continuing to experiment
with the volume two series

00:18:15.104 --> 00:18:16.057
so I hope you enjoyed it.

